# Official OpenAI multimodal text+image model quick list (checked 2026-04-25).
# Verified against official OpenAI docs/pricing. Standard short-context API pricing
# below is per 1M text tokens: input / cached input / output. Long-context,
# Batch/Flex/Priority, and regional processing rates can differ.
# - gpt-5.5:      $5.00 / $0.50  / $30.00  -> newest frontier model; use deliberately for hard tests/work
# - gpt-5.5-pro:  $30.00 / n/a   / $180.00 -> premium accuracy tier; avoid casual/default use
# - gpt-5.4:      $2.50 / $0.25  / $15.00  -> cost-aware default flagship for hard planning/reasoning tasks
# - gpt-5.4-pro:  $30.00 / n/a   / $180.00 -> premium 5.4 tier; avoid casual/default use
# - gpt-5.4-mini: $0.75 / $0.075 / $4.50   -> cheaper 5.4-family option for routine code/agent checks
# - gpt-5.4-nano: $0.20 / $0.02  / $1.25   -> cheapest 5.4-family option for simple structured checks
# - gpt-5.2:      $1.75 / $0.175 / $14.00  -> strong premium agent model when 5.1 is not enough
# - gpt-5.1:      $1.25 / $0.125 / $10.00  -> strong general-purpose agent/coding default
# - gpt-5:        $1.25 / $0.125 / $10.00  -> older GPT-5 baseline; usually prefer 5.1+
# - gpt-5-mini:   $0.25 / $0.025 / $2.00   -> cheap GPT-5-family option for structured repetitive work
# - gpt-4.1:      $2.00 / $0.50  / $8.00   -> strong precise tool-calling / instruction-following model
# - gpt-4.1-mini: $0.40 / $0.10  / $1.60   -> cheaper 4.1-family tool-caller for routine flows
# - gpt-4o:       $2.50 / $1.25  / $10.00  -> balanced multimodal default for richer screenshot understanding
# - gpt-4o-mini:  $0.15 / $0.075 / $0.60   -> cheapest useful multimodal triage/default for cheap iteration
